div
  .sb-preview
    .sbp-preview-content
      .row 
        .col
          center
            span(style='font-weight:bold;font-size: 24;') Google Authenticator
            div(*ngIf='!gauthEnabled', style='margin-top: 32px;   margin-bottom: 25px;')
              p Add an extra layer of security to your account by using Google Authenticator code in addition to your password each time you log in.
            div(*ngIf='errors.length > 0')
              sbpro-alert(classes='alert-danger', [dismissable]='true')
                | {{ errors[0] }}
            div(*ngIf='!gauthEnabled')
              div(*ngIf='!showQR')
                br
                button.btn(type='submit', (click)='generateGAuthQR()', class='castlerButtonColor') Enable 2-Factor Authentication
              div(*ngIf='showQR', style='text-align:left;')
                br
                ol
                  li Please download "Google Authenticator" APP on your smartphone.
                  li Open the App and scan the QR code
                  li Enter the OTP generated
                br
                img.svgIcon([src]='qr')
                div 
                  form([formGroup]='otpForm')
                    .form-group
                      br
                      label.small.mb-1(for='inputOTP') OTP
                      input#inputOTP.form-control.py-4(
                        data-cy='otp',
                        type='text',
                        placeholder='Enter OTP',
                        formControlName='otp',
                        [class.is-valid]='otpControlValid',
                        [class.is-invalid]='otpControlInvalid',
                        maxLength=6
                      )
                      .invalid-feedback(*ngIf='otpControl.hasError?.required')
                        | OTP is required.
                      .invalid-feedback(*ngIf='otpControl.hasError("minlength")')
                        | Enter the 6 digit OTP.
                      .invalid-feedback(*ngIf='otpControl.hasError("maxlength")')
                        | Enter the 6 digit OTP.
                      br
                      button.btn(
                        type='submit',
                        (click)='enableGAuth()',
                        [disabled]='otpForm.invalid',
                        class='textColor'
                      ) Verify and Enable 2-Factor Authentication
                      | &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&emsp;
                      button.btn.btn-link(type='submit', (click)='onCancel()') Cancel
            div(*ngIf='gauthEnabled', style='margin-top: 32px;margin-bottom: 25px;')
              | Google Authenticator is enabled for your account
